%S A334615 0,0,0,2,0,10,6,72,86,602,982,5426,10558,51246,111602,500076,1177210,
%T A334615 5001518,12462762,51003906,132711162,528420604,1422458280,5547419160,
%U A334615 15347206464,58894189434,166635736886,631318916606,1820096765522,6824651425150,19990790051350
%N A334615 a(n) is the number of semi-meanders with n top arches that has no arch of length 1 at the ends of the top arch configuration and no arch of length 1 adjacent to the center of the top arch configuration.
%C A334615 The number of semi-meanders with n top arches is A000682(n). If a formula for a(n) could be found without using the values for A000682(n) or A301620(n) then there would be a recursive formula for semi-meanders with n top arches.
%H A334615 Hunter Hogan, <a href="/A334615/b334615.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 2..45</a> (first 26 terms from Roger Ford).
%H A334615 Hunter Hogan, <a href="https://github.com/hunterhogan/mapFolding">mapFolding: Create, alter, and optimize algorithms to count meanders, stamp foldings, and map foldings</a>, GitHub repository, (2026).
%F A334615 For n >= 4: a(n) = A301620(n-2) - 2*A301620(n-3) = A000682(n) - 4*A000682(n-1) + 4*A000682(n-2). [corrected by _Hunter Hogan_, Jul 29 2026]
%F A334615 From _Hunter Hogan_, Aug 17 2026: (Start)
%F A334615 a(n) = (A337581(n+2) - 4*A337581(n+1) + 4*A337581(n))/4.
%F A334615 a(n) = (A001010(2*n-2) - 4*A001010(2*n-4) + 4*A001010(2*n-6))/2.
%F A334615 a(n) = 2*(A000560(n-1) - 4*A000560(n-2) + 4*A000560(n-3)).
%F A334615 For n >= 4: a(n) = b(n) - 4*b(n-1) + 4*b(n-2), where b(m) = (m-1)! - Sum_{k=3..m-1} (A223094(k)*(m-1)!/k!).
%F A334615 Let r = n mod 2. Then:
%F A334615 For n >= 4: a(n) = (2-r)*A227167(n)/n - 4*(1+r)*A227167(n-1)/(n-1) + 4*(2-r)*A227167(n-2)/(n-2).
%F A334615 a(n) = (A223093(n-1) + (1+r)*A005316(n-1)) - 4*(A223093(n-2) + (2-r)*A005316(n-2)) + 4*(A223093(n-3) + (1+r)*A005316(n-3)).
%F A334615 a(n) = (A217310(n-1) + 2*A005316(n-1))/(2-r) - 4*(A217310(n-2) + 2*A005316(n-2))/(1+r) + 4*(A217310(n-3) + 2*A005316(n-3))/(2-r).
%F A334615 a(n) = 2*(A259702(n) - 2*A259702(n-1)). (End)
%e A334615 For n = 7: a(7) = 10. 11111000001100, 11110000111000, 11110000101100, 11101000110100, 11100011110000, 11100011100100, 11011000111000, 11010011101000, 11001111100000, 11001011110000.
